    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Funnel is a narrative puzzle game mixing branching dialogue and challenging puzzle minigames. You have just been transferred to a new factory in a world where humanity has moved underground after a terrible war, but the details of your transfer don't seem to add up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every choice you make and every minigame you solve or don\u2019t solve will change the path that your story takes whether that\u2019s to escape the factory or to be a good worker and get your promotion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who do you trust</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who to work with or who to betray. Every crew mate you meet has their own plan for the future of the factory leading to different endings with entirely different minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/f944c38fa6686a0256fe3c86ed7c74fa.poster.avif?t=1755195538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/f944c38fa6686a0256fe3c86ed7c74fa.webm?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/f944c38fa6686a0256fe3c86ed7c74fa.mp4?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames are choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your dialogue choices, succeeding or failing in a minigame will change the outcome of your story. If someone asks you to attach a timer to a bomb and you fail, that character might sacrifice themselves since the bomb no longer has a delay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/53b424bcc5638d8d894213a3cdc15bc7.poster.avif?t=1755195538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/53b424bcc5638d8d894213a3cdc15bc7.webm?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/53b424bcc5638d8d894213a3cdc15bc7.mp4?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the mysteries that underpin this strange world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience The Funnel\u2019s unique world, diverging from our own timeline in the 1900s when a group of scientists in Old Philadelphia created the Funnel, a giant robotic structure that supposedly can average out the collective will of humanity. But why has the Funnel started appearing in your dreams?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/5d0c9d14f1458f4f802dcb6b9579ed26.poster.avif?t=1755195538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/5d0c9d14f1458f4f802dcb6b9579ed26.webm?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/5d0c9d14f1458f4f802dcb6b9579ed26.mp4?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Funnel is a narrative puzzle game mixing branching dialogue and challenging puzzle minigames. You have just been transferred to a new factory in a world where humanity has moved underground after a terrible war, but the details of your transfer don't seem to add up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Every choice you make and every minigame you solve or don\u2019t solve will change the path that your story takes whether that\u2019s to escape the factory or to be a good worker and get your promotion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who do you trust</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who to work with or who to betray. Every crew mate you meet has their own plan for the future of the factory leading to different endings with entirely different minigames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/f944c38fa6686a0256fe3c86ed7c74fa.poster.avif?t=1755195538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/f944c38fa6686a0256fe3c86ed7c74fa.webm?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/f944c38fa6686a0256fe3c86ed7c74fa.mp4?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames are choices</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just like your dialogue choices, succeeding or failing in a minigame will change the outcome of your story. If someone asks you to attach a timer to a bomb and you fail, that character might sacrifice themselves since the bomb no longer has a delay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/53b424bcc5638d8d894213a3cdc15bc7.poster.avif?t=1755195538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/53b424bcc5638d8d894213a3cdc15bc7.webm?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/53b424bcc5638d8d894213a3cdc15bc7.mp4?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the mysteries that underpin this strange world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience The Funnel\u2019s unique world, diverging from our own timeline in the 1900s when a group of scientists in Old Philadelphia created the Funnel, a giant robotic structure that supposedly can average out the collective will of humanity. But why has the Funnel started appearing in your dreams?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/5d0c9d14f1458f4f802dcb6b9579ed26.poster.avif?t=1755195538\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/5d0c9d14f1458f4f802dcb6b9579ed26.webm?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3164380/extras/5d0c9d14f1458f4f802dcb6b9579ed26.mp4?t=1755195538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Assemble gear boxes, meet your crew, escape the factory. Experience the unique underground steampunk world of The Funnel, where you may help or betray any of the people you meet. But be careful, the Funnel is watching...",
